{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Succubus Stories</i>\u00a0is an erotic text-based adventure game. You play as a peasant-girl-turned succubus, plotting her revenge against the powerful people who ruined her life and stole her family's land. She needs to consume a\u00a0<i>certain bodily fluid</i>\u00a0to survive, and has to manage her ravenous lust as she gets closer to her goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750980/extras/9038c1098e0d9c3b891d36f60df6927e.avif?t=1758252519\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At over 600,000 words total, with five choice-driven story chapters, 35 engaging side quests, and more than 80 unique activities with evolving choices and progression, <i>Succubus Stories</i> is a massive, detailed game that grants players tons of freedom in a large, reactive world. Have tons of hot sex in a variety of ways with anyone you want, make wacky potions from your &quot;leftovers,&quot; and unlock new sexy and seductive abilities as you work as both an alchemist and a prostitute in a well-realized fantasy world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750980/extras/ba92988410dbc4ff00b9dcf5bc0369b9.avif?t=1758252519\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750980/extras_big/ba92988410dbc4ff00b9dcf5bc0369b9.avif?t=1758252519 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based sexual encounters.</strong> Perform a variety of hot sex acts with both male and female partners using a dynamic encounter system that provides dozens of evolving options in a fun turn-based format.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tons of erotic content.</strong> Discover dozens of unique events, activities, game systems, and quests covering a wide-range of kinks and interesting game mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox-style gameplay.</strong> You have the freedom to interact with the world and NPCs at your discretion. Walk around nude, proposition characters for sex, engage in prostitution, or even get thrown in the dungeon for indecent behavior. The game responds to your reputation, fetishes, and behavior in interesting and realistic ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A compelling story.</strong> Enjoy a non-linear narrative with interesting characters, a truly choice-driven plot, and several surprising twists and turns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful progression.</strong> Unlock new behaviors and activities. Develop fetishes and sexual skills. Gain various traits and perks to further define your character. Use alchemy to create powerful potions with interesting effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mod support.</strong> The game features mod support, with\u00a0official mod tools and documentation\u00a0available for free to all users.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750980/extras/f1586dd677da9b734ec2abdc1b29dd7b.avif?t=1758252519\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750980/extras_big/f1586dd677da9b734ec2abdc1b29dd7b.avif?t=1758252519 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"World's Oldest Profession","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3750980/2f07f7a02463f45394a84055806d48e1fa51fca8.jpg"},{"name":"Drinking Buddies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamsta